CLAIM: P1 — Waterbirds final K=29, seeds 1·2·3: trustmask_v1 − teacher_topk val WGA = −2.01 [−6.32, +2.31]; superiority was not demonstrated, and the difference remains uncertain.
VERDICT: NEEDS-MORE
REASON: The six cited runs (v1 endings 2e3c/279c/fdca; teacher_topk endings f015/4535/d12a) support the arithmetic and cautious interpretation; all are done, matched for seeds/epochs/budget, with matching selector identities and verified past locks.
The mandatory decomposition evidence (§15) is explicitly absent, and the pre-method H-A27 analysis output supporting coverage weighting is missing (§16). Published [attention rollout](https://aclanthology.org/2020.acl-main.385/) establishes the attribution technique, not that weighting mechanism; the numerical diagnostic alone does not complete the requested audit.